$ An RBE3 that does not determine its reference grid: REFC 123, two weighting grids with 123, the reference grid 0.01
$ off the line through them, so rotation about that line is free. Rotated here to an orientation that current MYSTRAN
$ dev accepts (it solves 14 of 24 orientations of this element and rejects 10). The run must stop (ERROR 1957) and
$ write no displacements.
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = RBE3 RANK ORIENTATION 2
ECHO = NONE
SUBCASE 1
  LOAD = 1
  SPC = 1
  DISPLACEMENT = ALL
BEGIN BULK
GRID    1001            0.      0.      0.              123456
GRID    1002            0.1     0.      0.              123456
GRID    1003            0.05    0.0045360.008912
RBE3    1001            1003    123     1.      123     1001    1002    
FORCE   1       1003    0       1.      1.      1.      1.
SPC1    1       123456  999999
GRID    999998          8.      9.      9.              123456
GRID    999999          9.      9.      9.              123456
CROD    1       1       999998  999999
MAT1    1       7.0E10          0.33    2700.
PROD    1       1       1.0E-4
PARAM   AUTOSPC YES
ENDDATA
